LVGL submodule, applied after 02 and before 03: the built-in Montserrat fonts declared const (flash),
and Montserrat 14 and 18 regenerated at 1 bpp, ASCII only, without kerning. 03 applies on top of these
two files. Found by the gap audit of the 2.4.102 build tree (README, Gap audit): the build tree had these
changes and no patch carried them.

